# MovieHub AI Service

## PROJECT GOAL

Build a production-inspired AI service for the existing MovieHub application using FastAPI.

The purpose is simultaneously:

1. Build a real AI service.
2. Learn FastAPI deeply.
3. Learn production backend engineering.
4. Learn GenAI engineering.
5. Understand how modern AI applications are architected.
6. Learn by implementing the underlying concepts rather than blindly using frameworks.

---

# EXISTING ARCHITECTURE

MovieHub already has a Django/DRF backend.

Django remains responsible for core MovieHub functionality.

Django responsibilities:

- Users
- Authentication
- Movies
- Actors
- Genres
- Watchlist
- Watch history
- Movie APIs
- TMDB integration
- Core business logic
- Existing PostgreSQL data
- Existing Redis/Celery infrastructure
- Existing embedding generation
- Existing semantic movie search

DO NOT migrate the existing Django backend to FastAPI.

FastAPI is a new AI service.

