# IMPORTANT

Do not skip directly to advanced phases.

Do not implement future phases prematurely.

At every phase:

1. Understand the requirement.
2. Identify the concepts needed.
3. Learn those concepts.
4. Design the solution.
5. Implement it.
6. Test it.
7. Debug it.
8. Discuss production considerations.
9. Only then move forward.

The ultimate objective is not merely a working MovieHub AI.

The objective is for me to understand how to design and build production-grade AI backends myself.